eginning in August 2027. Read more Front Desk Receptionist Student Success Center Academic Affairs Part Time Temp (less than 28 hours) The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, is seeking applicants for a part-time Front Desk Receptionist in our Academic Support Center to work Monday - Thursday evenings. Read more Professional Math Tutor - The Citadel Math Lab Student Success Center Academic Affairs Part Time Temp (less than 28 hours) The Citadel Math Lab is seeking reliable and enthusiastic Professional Math Tutor to provide academic support to students in a collaborative learning environment. Read more Mathematics Adjunct Faculty (pooled position) Mathematical Sciences Science and Mathematics Adjunct Faculty The Department of Mathematical Sciences at The Citadel invites applications for Full-time or Part-time Mathematics Adjunct Faculty. Read more Executive Director, Student Affairs and Academic Services Provost and Dean of College Office of the Provost Student Affairs Full Time Permanent - Staff Band 8 The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina is accepting applications for the Executive Director of Student Affairs and Academic Services. Reporting to the Provost, the Executive Director for Student Affairs and Academic Services provides senior level leadership within the Division of Academic Affairs. Read more Graduate Assistant - Intramural Athletics Student Affairs Academic Srvs Student Affairs Student worker The Intramural Athletics Program is looking to bring on a Graduate Assistant for the 2026-2027 academic year. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Physical Activity Courses (pooled position) Health and Human Performance Science and Mathematics Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, is currently accepting applications to establish a pool of qualified candidates for adjunct faculty assignments. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Sport Management (pooled position) Health and Human Performance Science and Mathematics Adjunct Fa