    "https://jobs.citadel.edu/jobs/adjunct-faculty-in-the-department-of-cyber-and-computer-sciences-charleston-south-carolina-united-states": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty in the Department of Cyber and Computer Sciences",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty in the Department of Cyber and Computer Sciences - Charleston, South Carolina, United States The Military College of South Carolina Search All Jobs Applicant Login Candidate Settings Home Benefits About The Citadel Discover Charleston New Employees Home Benefits About The Citadel Discover Charleston New Employees Kiosk mode Adjunct Faculty in the Department of Cyber and Computer Sciences Cyber and Computer Sciences Adjunct Faculty Add to favorites View favorites The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina is seeking applicants for adjunct faculty in the Department of Cyber and Computer Sciences. Our goal is to build long-term relationships with high-quality adjunct part-time faculty members from Industry who share in the Citadel commitment to develop principled leaders in Cyber and Computer Sciences. Job Responsibilities: There are three main programs that adjunct faculty may be employed to teach classes: Traditional undergraduate program, which features face-to-face classes to the South Carolina Corps of Cadets Undergraduate evening 2+2 programs, which are primarily working adults earning Bachelor’s degrees Our joint graduate evening programs in Computer and Information Sciences with College of Charleston. We have ongoing needs to fill vacancies in one or more of the following areas: Cybersecurity Cyber Operations Software Engineering Web Programming Minimum Qualifications: To teach at the undergraduate level, applicants must have a minimum of a Master's degree from an Accredited Institution in the Computer Science/Information Systems/Cybersecurity discipline or in a closely related field To teach at the graduate level, applicants must hold a terminal degree in the field from an Accredited Institution in the Computer Science/Information Systems/Cybersecurity discipline or in a closely related field Preference will be given to applicants who have previous effective teaching experience. Official transcripts indicating education level are required prior to employment. If you have questions, please contact Dr. Shankar Banik by phone at: 843-953-5039, or by email at: shankar.banik@citadel.edu . Review of applications will begin immediately and will continue until all positions are filled. Start Your Application First Name (required) c3601ce9 Last Name (required) a2fd5e36 Email (required) 63066807 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you. You'll be redirected to login and continue your application! Recommended Jobs Grounds Maintenance Specialist Charleston Facilities & Engineering The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina is seeking a Grounds Maintenance Specialist to work in the Grounds Division.  This role will report to the Grounds Division Chief and is responsible for the routine maintenance and enhancements of the landscape at the residence of the President of the college, to also include general maintenance. Dean - School of Engineering Charleston Provost and Dean of College The Citadel invites nominations and applications for the position of Dean of the School of Engineering, who also holds the Col. Louis S. Le Tellier Chair in Engineering. Candidates must hold an earned doctorate and demonstrate a strong commitment to advancing education and scholarship at a student-centered college. Please Note: Due to recent federal changes with H1B visa fees, The Citadel is currently not sponsoring new H1B applications. 171 Moultrie Street Charleston, SC 29409 United States 843.225.3294 Facebook Twitter Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Student Types Corps of Cadets Graduate Students Degree Completion Students Veteran Students Online Students Schools Tommy and Victoria Baker School of Business School of Engineering School of Humanities and Social Sciences Swain Family School of Science and Mathematics Zucker Family School of Education Department of Leadership Studies Next Steps Apply Now Application Status Request Info Schedule a Visit 360 Tour Legal & Compliance Accessibility Privacy 