    "https://jobs.citadel.edu/jobs/search/search-page-faculty?page=1": {
      "title": "Discover Faculty Positions",
      "description": "Search Page (Faculty) The Military College of South Carolina Search All Jobs Applicant Login Candidate Settings Home Benefits About The Citadel Discover Charleston New Employees Home Benefits About The Citadel Discover Charleston New Employees Kiosk mode Discover Faculty Positions Skip to jobs search results Clear Filters Department Search departments 22 filter options found Department Accounting and Finance (5 items) 5 Biology (1 items) 1 Chemistry (1 items) 1 Civil and Environmental Eng (1 items) 1 Cyber and Computer Sciences (2 items) 2 Eng Leadership and Prog Mgt (1 items) 1 English Fine Arts and Comm (2 items) 2 Health and Human Performance (3 items) 3 History (1 items) 1 Intel & Security Studies (1 items) 1 Leadership Studies (1 items) 1 Mathematical Sciences (1 items) 1 Mechanical Engineering (1 items) 1 Mgmt and Entrepreneurship (1 items) 1 Mktg Supl Chain and Econ (3 items) 3 Modern Language (5 items) 5 Nursing (1 items) 1 Physics (1 items) 1 Political Science (1 items) 1 Provost and Dean of College (2 items) 2 Psychology (2 items) 2 Zucker Family School of Ed (6 items) 6 Employment Type Search employment types 3 filter options found Employment Type Adjunct Faculty (36 items) 36 Full Time Permanent - Faculty (7 items) 7 Full Time Permanent - Staff (1 items) 1 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A Dean - School of Engineering Provost and Dean of College Full Time Permanent - Faculty The Citadel invites nominations and applications for the position of Dean of the School of Engineering, who also holds the Col. Louis S. Le Tellier Chair in Engineering. Candidates must hold an earned doctorate and demonstrate a strong commitment to advancing education and scholarship at a student-centered college. Read more Provost and Dean of the College Provost and Dean of College Full Time Permanent - Faculty Full Time Permanent - Staff The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, seeks an accomplished academic leader to serve as Provost and Dean of the College. Reporting to the President, the Provost serves as the College's Chief Academic Officer, directing the Deans of the College's Schools and collaborating with the Commandant's office to align the academic and military components of a Citadel education. The Provost will also collaborate with the college’s other Vice Presidents as part of the President’s senior leadership team. Read more Tenure-Track Assistant, Associate or Full Professor of Finance Accounting and Finance Full Time Permanent - Faculty The Tommy and Victoria Baker School of Business at The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, invites applications for a full-time, tenure-track position in Finance at the Assistant, Associate or Full Professor level, beginning Fall 2027. Read more Department Head and Associate Professor/Professor of Accounting or Finance Accounting and Finance Full Time Permanent - Faculty The Tommy & Victoria Baker School of Business at The Citadel invites applications and nominations for the position of Department Head and Associate Professor/Professor in the Department of Accounting & Finance. This is an outstanding opportunity to lead a thriving undergraduate department of approximately 300 students and 10 full-time faculty members within an AACSB-accredited business school committed to academic excellence, principled leadership, and continuous improvement.\n\nThe successful candidate will serve as Department Head while holding a tenured faculty appointment in either Accounting or Finance at the rank of Associate Professor or Professor, commensurate with qualifications and experience. The Department Head reports directly to the Associate Dean of the Tommy & Victoria Baker School of Business. Read more Assistant/Associate/Full Professor of Accounting Accounting and Finance Full Time Permanent - Faculty The Baker School of Business invites applications for a tenure-track position in the area of accounting at the level of Assistant, Associate Professor or Professor beginning in August 2027. Read more Mathematics Adjunct Faculty (pooled position) Mathematical Sciences Adjunct Faculty The Department of Mathematical Sciences at The Citadel invites applications for Full-time or Part-time Mathematics Adjunct Faculty. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Physical Activity Courses (pooled position) Health and Human Performance Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, is currently accepting applications to establish a pool of qualified candidates for adjunct faculty assignments. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Sport Management (pooled position) Health and Human Performance Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, is currently accepting applications to establish a pool of qualified candidates for adjunct faculty assignments. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Exercise Science (pooled position) Health and Human Performance Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina, is currently accepting applications to establish a pool of qualified candidates for adjunct faculty assignments. Read more Tenure-track Assistant Professor or Instructor in Cyber Operations Cyber and Computer Sciences Full Time Permanent - Faculty The Department of Cyber and Computer Sciences at The Citadel, located in beautiful Charleston, South Carolina, invites applications for a full-time, 9-month faculty position at the rank of Tenure-Track Assistant Professor or Instructor, with a start date of January 2026 or August 2026. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Citadel Division of Educational Leadership (pooled position) Zucker Family School of Ed Adjunct Faculty The Citadel’s Zucker Family School of Education invites applicants for an adjunct faculty position in the Division of Educational Leadership to be filled for the fall and spring semester. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Psychology (pooled positions) Psychology Adjunct Faculty The Department of Psychology at The Citadel is seeking applications for adjunct faculty positions.  Courses taught will be at both the graduate level and the undergraduate level. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Department of Engineering Leadership and Program Management (pooled) Eng Leadership and Prog Mgt Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina is seeking applicants for an adjunct faculty position in The Department of Engineering Leadership and Program Management for the fall, spring, and summer semesters. Read more Adjunct Faculty – Department of Leadership Studies (pooled position) Leadership Studies Adjunct Faculty The Department of Leadership Studies at The Citadel is accepting applications for adjunct faculty (multiple positions) to teach undergraduate and/or graduate level courses. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Modern Languages - German (pooled position) Modern Language Adjunct Faculty The Citadel's German Program welcomes applications for Adjunct Instructors for Fall. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Department of Mechanical Engineering (pooled positions) Mechanical Engineering Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina is seeking applicants for an adjunct faculty position in The Department of Mechanical Engineering for the fall and spring semesters. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Modern Languages - Spanish (pooled position) Modern Language Adjunct Faculty The Department of Languages, Literatures & Cultures at The Citadel seeks applicants for adjunct faculty positions in Spanish. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Baker School of Business - Management and Entrepreneurship Mgmt and Entrepreneurship Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina is seeking applicants for adjunct faculty in Management and Entrepreneurship disciplines in the Baker School of Business. Read more Assistant Professor - School Psychology Psychology Full Time Permanent - Faculty The Department of Psychology at The Citadel invites applications for a tenure-track Assistant Professor in School Psychology to begin in August 2026. Located in historic Charleston, South Carolina, The Citadel has been ranked for the past 10 years (by U.S. News and World Report) as the top public college in the South among master’s-granting institutions and is currently ranked as the top regional university in the south. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Modern Languages - French (pooled position) Modern Language Adjunct Faculty The Department of Languages, Literatures & Cultures welcomes applications for adjunct faculty instructors in French. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Department of Intelligence and Security Studies (pooled positions) Intel & Security Studies Adjunct Faculty The Citadel's Department of Intelligence and Security Studies is establishing a pool of applicants to fill potential part-time teaching positions for undergraduate and/or graduate positions. Read more Adjunct Faculty - Counselor Education Zucker Family School of Ed Adjunct Faculty The Citadel’s Zucker Family School of Education (ZFSOE) is establishing a pool of applicants to fill potential part-time temporary teaching positions in the Division of Counselor Education. Read more Adjunct Faculty in the Department of Cyber and Computer Sciences Cyber and Computer Sciences Adjunct Faculty The Citadel, The Military College of South Carolina is seeking applicants for adjunct faculty in the Department of Cyber and Computer Sciences. Our goal is to build long-term relationships with high-quality adjunct part-time faculty members from Industry who share in the Citadel commitment to develop principled leaders in Cyber and Computer Sciences. Read more Adjunct Faculty in Fine Arts - Citadel's Department of English, Fine Arts, and Communications (pooled position) English Fine Arts and Comm Adjunct Faculty The Citadel’s Department of English, Fine Arts, and Communications is establishing a pool of applicants to fill part